{"id": "train-36-001", "text": "Nothing on this phone will go online anymore and I have not touched a thing. My grandson set it up and now it is useless.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-002", "text": "I was trying to look up the weather this morning and the page just says there is no connection. Nothing works at all, not the news, not my email, nothing.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-003", "text": "There is a little picture of an airplane at the top of my screen and I have never been on a plane with this phone. Since it showed up I can't get onto anything.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-004", "text": "WhatsApp keeps saying it is connecting and never does. My email won't come in either. What on earth has happened?", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-005", "text": "I was at the pharmacy and pressed something by accident while putting the phone in my purse. Since then none of my apps can reach the internet. Please help me.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-006", "text": "How do I turn the internet back on? Everything says I am offline and I don't know where to look.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-007", "text": "My daughter says my mobile data is switched off. I don't know what that means or how to switch it back on.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-008", "text": "I can't get YouTube or Facebook or anything to load. When I am at home it used to just work and now it says no internet everywhere.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-009", "text": "The bank app says check your connection and so does every other app. I am worried I will miss paying a bill.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-010", "text": "I think I turned on some battery or data saving thing because a box popped up and I said yes. Now my apps won't load anything unless I open them and wait forever, and most of the time not even then.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-011", "text": "The phone says it is connected to my home network, it even shows the name, but nothing will load. Pages just spin and spin.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-012", "text": "I have full bars on the little fan shape at the top and still YouTube says there is no connection. How can that be?", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-013", "text": "It says connected under our Wi-Fi name, the one from the cable company, but Google won't open anything. I am very frustrated.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-014", "text": "My phone shows a check mark next to the house network and yet my email won't come through and the news won't load.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-015", "text": "I am sitting right next to the box with the blinking lights and the phone says it's connected, but every page just stays blank.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-016", "text": "Why does it say I am connected when nothing works? I was trying to video call my granddaughter on WhatsApp and it keeps failing.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-017", "text": "At the library the phone joined their network and shows full signal, but the pages never come up. Same thing at home since yesterday.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-018", "text": "The phone tells me it is connected and the signal is strong, but Google Maps can't find anything and the weather app is empty.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-019", "text": "How do I fix it when the phone is on the Wi-Fi but the internet won't actually work? My tablet on the same network is fine.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-020", "text": "After the power went out last night my phone reconnected to our network, it says so right there, but no website will open. I've waited all morning.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-021", "text": "My sister says she called me three times yesterday and I never heard a thing. The phone just shows the missed calls later.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-022", "text": "The phone doesn't ring anymore. I only find out somebody called when I see the little red number. This is how I miss my doctor's office.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-023", "text": "I think I put it on silent at church on Sunday and now I can't get the ringing back. How do I make it ring again?", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-024", "text": "When people call me it only buzzes very softly in my pocket and makes no sound. I don't want buzzing, I want ringing.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-025", "text": "There's a little moon picture at the top of the screen and since it appeared nobody's calls make a sound.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-026", "text": "My son calls me on WhatsApp and I never hear it ring. Then I see he tried four times. He thinks I am ignoring him.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-027", "text": "I turned the sound down during a movie and now the phone does not ring at all. I have missed two calls from the pharmacy.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-028", "text": "How do I get my phone to ring out loud? The ring volume must be all the way down and I can't find where to turn it up.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-029", "text": "Every call comes in completely quiet. I only notice if I happen to be looking at the screen. I live alone and this worries me.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-030", "text": "The phone has gone quiet for calls. Do Not Disturb, my neighbor said, but I don't know what that is or how to undo it.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-031", "text": "My text messages don't make any noise anymore. I only see them hours later when I happen to open the phone.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-032", "text": "WhatsApp messages from my family don't show up until I open WhatsApp myself. Then there are ten of them waiting.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-033", "text": "I used to hear a little ding when an email came in. Now nothing, and I find out I missed something important.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-034", "text": "My bank sends me alerts about my account and they come in a whole day late. That is not acceptable with money.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-035", "text": "Nothing pops up at the top of the screen anymore when I get a message. I have to go looking for everything.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-036", "text": "How do I get my messages to tell me when they arrive? They just sit there silently until I check.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-037", "text": "After the phone did some kind of update, my Facebook and my messages stopped letting me know about anything.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-038", "text": "My grandson sent me pictures and I didn't know until the next morning when I opened the app. The phone never made a sound or showed a thing.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-039", "text": "The little notices from my pill reminder app have stopped coming. I nearly forgot my blood pressure medicine.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-040", "text": "The app notifications are all late or missing. My church group chat is having conversations and I am the last to know.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-041", "text": "My phone has started talking to me. It reads out everything I touch in a man's voice and I can't make it stop.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-042", "text": "There is a green box that jumps around the screen wherever I press, and nothing opens when I tap it once.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-043", "text": "I have to tap everything twice now and the phone announces each thing out loud. I don't know what I did.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-044", "text": "I can't scroll down my emails anymore. It just moves the box and talks. Someone told me to use two fingers, but why?", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-045", "text": "Please help, the phone is reading everything to me like I'm blind. I can see fine. I only want it to be normal again.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-046", "text": "I was in the settings trying to make the letters bigger and something switched on that speaks every word on the screen.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-047", "text": "How do I turn off the talking? My granddaughter called it TalkBack but she lives far away and I can't figure it out.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-048", "text": "I can't even answer a call properly, it says the name of the button out loud and a single press does nothing.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-049", "text": "I tried to open YouTube and it just said YouTube out loud and drew a rectangle around it. Tapping again finally opened it. This is maddening.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-050", "text": "The phone narrates everything I do and puts a frame around it. Unlocking it takes me five minutes now.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-051", "text": "My screen has gone all gray, like an old television. All my pictures of the grandchildren have no color.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-052", "text": "Everything on the phone is black and white now. I didn't change anything, it just happened this morning.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-053", "text": "The colors are all backwards, white is black and the faces in my photos look like negatives from the drug store.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-054", "text": "The whole screen has a strange yellowish green look to it and it gives me a headache. Even the photos look sick.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-055", "text": "I was playing with the settings trying to fix something else and now my phone is in black and white. How do I get the colors back?", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-056", "text": "My Google Maps looks like a photo negative. Everything is dark where it should be light and the colors are wrong.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-057", "text": "The screen looks washed out and gray. My daughter says there's a grayscale thing turned on but she couldn't find it.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-058", "text": "Why does my phone look like someone put a pink filter over it? The colors were fine last week.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-059", "text": "Ever since I pressed the side buttons together by accident the screen has been inverted, light and dark switched around.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-060", "text": "The colors on my phone are all wrong and I can't tell the red buttons from the green ones anymore. Please tell me how to fix it.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-061", "text": "The screen is so dark I can barely read anything. I have to hold it right up to the lamp.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-062", "text": "When I'm outside in the garden I can't see the phone at all. It is just a dark glass.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-063", "text": "The phone keeps getting darker on its own. I turn it up and a little later it's dim again.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-064", "text": "How do I make my screen brighter? I'm squinting at it all day and my eyes are tired.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-065", "text": "I was reading the paper on the phone and the screen went darker and darker by itself. It didn't turn off, just dark.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-066", "text": "The brightness won't go up any further, the bar is all the way over and it is still too dim for me.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-067", "text": "My granddaughter's phone is nice and bright and mine looks like it's in the shade. What's wrong with it?", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-068", "text": "I can't see the map on Google Maps when I'm walking outside because the screen is too dark. I nearly got lost.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-069", "text": "After the update the whole display looks gloomy. Everything is there but it's so faint I can't read it.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-070", "text": "Please help me turn the light on the screen up. I think there's something called adaptive brightness doing it, but I don't know.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-071", "text": "I'm trying to read a recipe and the screen goes black every few seconds. I have to keep touching it with flour on my hands.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-072", "text": "The phone locks itself almost right away. I put it down for a moment and I have to unlock it all over again.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-073", "text": "When I'm reading my emails the screen shuts off before I finish a paragraph. It's very aggravating.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-074", "text": "How do I make the screen stay on longer? It goes dark so quickly I can't keep up.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-075", "text": "I was watching my grandson's school play video in my messages and the screen kept going black in the middle.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-076", "text": "Every time I stop touching the phone for a few seconds it turns off and I have to put my code in again.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-077", "text": "The screen timeout is too short, my friend told me, but I have no idea where to change it.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-078", "text": "I read the Bible on my phone in the evening and the screen keeps going dark on me. I'm getting tired of it.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-079", "text": "While I look at the directions on Google Maps the screen goes black and I lose my place. It never used to do that.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-080", "text": "The phone goes to sleep far too quickly. I'm a slow reader and it doesn't give me any time.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-081", "text": "The letters on this phone are so tiny I can't read my messages even with my glasses on.", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-082", "text": "How do I make the writing bigger? Everything is too small for my eyes.", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-083", "text": "I can barely make out the names in my contacts. The print is minuscule.", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-084", "text": "My new phone has the smallest words I have ever seen. My old one was much easier to read.", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-085", "text": "The little pictures for the apps and their names under them are too small. I keep pressing the wrong one.", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-086", "text": "I want a bigger font size on everything, not just one app. Please tell me how.", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-087", "text": "I can't read the text messages from my doctor's office, the words are so small. I have to ask my neighbor to read them.", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-088", "text": "Reading the news on my phone gives me a headache because the type is so tiny.", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-089", "text": "After the phone updated, all the words seem to have shrunk. Can you make them large again?", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-090", "text": "Please make the letters larger. I'm seventy-eight and I simply can't see writing this small.", "labels": ["text_too_small"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-091", "text": "My little wireless ear pieces won't connect to the phone anymore. They worked fine last week.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-092", "text": "I bought a speaker for the kitchen and the phone won't find it. I've tried for an hour.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-093", "text": "My car used to play my phone calls through the radio and now it says no phone connected.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-094", "text": "How do I get my new earbuds to work with this phone? The box says to pair them but I don't know how.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-095", "text": "My watch that counts my steps has lost the phone and won't hook back up. My daughter gave it to me for my birthday.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-096", "text": "I think the Bluetooth is turned off but I don't know how to turn it on.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-097", "text": "The hearing earbuds my audiologist gave me stopped talking to the phone after it restarted. I can't hear my calls well without them.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-098", "text": "I was listening to a sermon on YouTube with my earbuds and they suddenly dropped off and won't reconnect.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-099", "text": "The phone can't see my wireless headphones at all. They're charged and the little light is blinking.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-100", "text": "My grandson's speaker worked with my phone at Christmas but now it won't connect no matter what I do.", "labels": ["bluetooth_earphones"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-101", "text": "WhatsApp won't let me send a voice message. It says it needs the microphone and I don't know what to say yes to.", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-102", "text": "The camera works fine on its own, but when I try to send a photo in Facebook it says it can't use the camera.", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-103", "text": "Google Maps can't find where I am. It keeps asking for my location and I don't know what button to press.", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-104", "text": "My bank app wants to take a picture of a check and says it doesn't have permission for the camera. What does that mean?", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-105", "text": "I said no to something in WhatsApp by mistake and now video calls show a black screen on my side.", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-106", "text": "How do I let Zoom use my microphone? My church group can't hear me in the meeting but the phone calls are fine.", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-107", "text": "The weather app says it can't tell where I am, so it shows the weather for some other city.", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-108", "text": "My pharmacy app wants to scan my prescription but the camera won't open inside it. Everywhere else the camera works.", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-109", "text": "A box popped up in the taxi app asking about my location and I pressed don't allow. Now it can't find me.", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-110", "text": "Instagram keeps saying it needs access to my camera and microphone. I tapped deny because it scared me. How do I undo that?", "labels": ["app_permission"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-111", "text": "My nephew says I should reset the network settings on my phone. How do I do that?", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-112", "text": "I want to reset the Wi-Fi and Bluetooth and mobile settings back to how they were. Not the whole phone, just those.", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-113", "text": "Can you reset my phone's internet connections? I don't want to lose my pictures, just start the connections over.", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-114", "text": "The man at the phone store told me to reset network settings. I'm scared to do it wrong. Please walk me through it.", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-115", "text": "I need all the connection settings put back to the beginning. I tried everything else with my Wi-Fi and my earbuds.", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-116", "text": "How do I wipe out the saved networks and Bluetooth things and start fresh? I don't want to erase my phone.", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-117", "text": "Please reset the phone's network part. My granddaughter said it would fix my troubles and I trust her.", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-118", "text": "I'd like to clear out all the Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and cell settings at once. Someone on the help line said that's the next step.", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-119", "text": "Is there a way to reset only the connection settings? I've been fiddling for days and I want it all set back to the start.", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-36-120", "text": "My son told me on the phone to do a network reset before he comes over this weekend. Where do I find that?", "labels": ["reset_network"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-36", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
